meta {
  name: Events - Answer - Set - Full event
  type: http
  seq: 197
}

put {
  url: {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/communities/nswswk8w8wso0ko8owwk8k0w/spaces/<cuid of an events space>/events/<cuid of an event>/answer
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "answer": "yes"
  }
}

docs {
  Error case: the event has a limit of places (capacity) and as many Yes answers of members who can read the space: 422, "This event is full." Your old answer stays. "no" and "replay" are still accepted, and the same Yes again answers 200. A member who changes a Yes to another answer frees a place; nobody takes it for another member (there is no waiting list).
}
